 "title": "Trance Saw Lead",
 "category": "Leads and stabs",
 "text": "Sound: the huge, shimmering detuned-saw lead of 90s trance and rave anthems: a wall of saws, wide and bright, washing into echoes and reverb.\n\nHow it's built: three saws on each note, one in tune, one a little sharp, one a little flat, so they shimmer; an open Ladder filter; Chorus (Ensemble) for width, a Delay and a large Reverb. Four voices.\n\nPlay: soaring melodies and chords; long notes.\n\nTweak: the TUNE of the detuned oscillators (more is wider), the reverb's SIZE and MIX, the delay's TIME.",
